scene downed_revive
note from v1_client_revive: the client goes down next to the host, the host gets 2 medkits, frames the downed client and revives it with F
@C closeui
@D closeui
@C time 12:00
@C tp peer+150
@D hp 10
@D wait log NOLA\sLIFE:\sCAIDO timeout=6
@C give Medkit 2
@C frame peer
@C box peer
@C shot downed key=peer all=1
@C key F 150
@D wait log NOLA\sLIFE:\sDE\sPE timeout=8
